  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EMHRF MENA 2023-2026 - EMHRF MENA 2023 2026 NEW</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EMHRF MENA 2023-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EMHRFs m&#xE5;l &#xE4;r att att fr&#xE4;mja och f&#xF6;rsvara respekten f&#xF6;r m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter i MENA-regionen. Implementering p&#xE5;g&#xE5;r mellan 2023-2026, genom ett k&#xE4;rnst&#xF6;d med en total budget om 53 MSEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EMHRF&#x2019;s aim is to protect and strengthen the human rights agency through promoting and defending respect for human rights in the MENA region. Implementation is conducted between 2023-2026, through a core support with a total budget of 53 MSEK.</narrative>
  </description>
